      "sourceHash": "9927c136ccfe0e5b",
      "translationZh": "将提示解码为 seq 0，通过将其单元格共享给 seq 1",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a365d1ab8fe0e261",
      "translationZh": "llama_memory_seq_cp（llama-batched-bench 对 -pps 所做的操作），然后保持",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63d23b3a2d129542",
      "translationZh": "解码两个序列。对于共享清除的 k-pool 模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a19f2f7034b92b49",
